{
  "name": "dsh-model-quick-picker",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "双栏模型选择器：左供应商右模型 + 常显搜索 + 最近使用 + 思考等级横排直选，并按供应商显示剩余积分/余额/额度。dsh-our-free-model 的配套附属插件（可独立使用）。 A two-column model picker for dsh with search, recents, inline reasoning effort, and per-provider credits/balance. Companion plugin to dsh-our-free-model.",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README_EN.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "model-picker",
    "model-selection",
    "ui",
    "our-free-model",
    "companion-plugin"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2"
  }
}
